<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= union_try_pick \\* t. (key : string) : option t =\n    := fields = ~> get_union_fields_untag `t ()\n    fields\n    ++ (\n        fields\n        |> listm::map \\ key', x =>\n            key' |> sm'::to_lower, x\n    )\n    |> listm'::box\n    |> listm'::to_array'\n    |> \\ x => array x : array _\n    |> am'::try_pick \\ key', x =>\n        ? key' =. key\n        ?> Some x\n        |: None\n\n///- --timeout 900000","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := union_try_pick \* t. (key : string) : option t =
      := fields = ~> get_union_fields_untag `t ()
      fields
      ++ (
          fields
          |> listm::map \ key', x =>
              key' |> sm'::to_lower, x
      )
      |> listm'::box
      |> listm'::to_array'
      |> \ x => array x : array _
      |> am'::try_pick \ key', x =>
          ? key' =. key
          ?> Some x
          |: None

  ///- --timeout 900000
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

