#### union_cases_fold (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> gleam\n///> lua\n///> cuda\n///> rust\n///> typescript\n\nunion_cases_fold (\\ count (_ : reflection_test_target) => count + 1i32) 0i32\n|> _assert_eq 2i32\n\nunion_cases_fold (\\ found (target : reflection_test_target) => ? target = Contract ?> !+ |: found) !-\n|> _assert_eq !+","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> gleam
  ///> lua
  ///> cuda
  ///> rust
  ///> typescript

  union_cases_fold (\ count (_ : reflection_test_target) => count + 1i32) 0i32
  |> _assert_eq 2i32

  union_cases_fold (\ found (target : reflection_test_target) => ? target = Contract ?> !+ |: found) !-
  |> _assert_eq !+
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= union_cases_find \\* union_type. (matches : union_type -> bool) : option union_type =\n    :~ ^ search (cases : list union_type) : option union_type =\n        ?= cases ?|\n        | case :: rest => ? matches case ?> Some case |: search rest\n        | [] => None\n    search (union_cases_fold (\\ acc (case : union_type) => case :: acc) [] |> dyn)\n\n///- --timeout 900000","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := union_cases_find \* union_type. (matches : union_type -> bool) : option union_type =
      :~ ^ search (cases : list union_type) : option union_type =
          ?= cases ?|
          | case :: rest => ? matches case ?> Some case |: search rest
          | [] => None
      search (union_cases_fold (\ acc (case : union_type) => case :: acc) [] |> dyn)

  ///- --timeout 900000
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### union_cases_find (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> gleam\n///> lua\n///> cuda\n///> rust\n///> typescript\n\nunion_cases_find \\ (target : reflection_test_target) => target = Contract\n|> _assert_eq (Some Contract)\n\nunion_cases_find \\ (_ : reflection_test_target) => !-\n|> _assert_eq None","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

