### case_name

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= case_name \\* t. (x : t) : string = !!!!UnionCaseName(x)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := case_name \* t. (x : t) : string = !!!!UnionCaseName(x)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

