<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= get_record_fields \\* t u. (x : t) : list (string * u) =\n    ~>\n        real_core::record_type_fold_back\n            \\ key =>\n                \\* u'. acc =>\n                    := k = sm'_real::symbol_to_string_real `(`key)\n                    := v = x key\n                    (::) `(string * u') (k, v) acc\n            `t\n            (Nil `(string * u))","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
