<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= get_functions_types \\* t {record}. (fns : t) =\n    ~>\n        := get_function_type \\* t. =\n            := args \\* t {record}. : list (string * string) =\n                real_core::record_type_fold_back\n                    \\ key =>\n                        \\* v. acc =>\n                            := k = sm'_real::symbol_to_string_real `(`key)\n                            := v = $'\"`v\"' : string\n                            (::) `(string * string) (k, v) acc\n                    `t\n                    (Nil `(string * string))\n\n            ?: t ?|\n            | ~t -> ~u => args `t, ($'\"`u\"' : string)\n\n        real_core::record_type_fold_back\n            \\ key =>\n                \\* v. acc =>\n                    := k = sm'_real::symbol_to_string_real `(`key)\n                    := args, result = get_function_type `v\n                    (::) `(string * (list (string * string) * string)) (k, (args, result)) acc\n            `(`fns)\n            (Nil `(string * (list (string * string) * string)))\n    |> \\ x => x : list (string * (list (string * string) * string))","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := get_functions_types \* t {record}. (fns : t) =
      ~>
          := get_function_type \* t. =
              := args \* t {record}. : list (string * string) =
                  real_core::record_type_fold_back
                      \ key =>
                          \* v. acc =>
                              := k = sm'_real::symbol_to_string_real `(`key)
                              := v = $'"`v"' : string
                              (::) `(string * string) (k, v) acc
                      `t
                      (Nil `(string * string))

              ?: t ?|
              | ~t -> ~u => args `t, ($'"`u"' : string)

          real_core::record_type_fold_back
              \ key =>
                  \* v. acc =>
                      := k = sm'_real::symbol_to_string_real `(`key)
                      := args, result = get_function_type `v
                      (::) `(string * (list (string * string) * string)) (k, (args, result)) acc
              `(`fns)
              (Nil `(string * (list (string * string) * string)))
      |> \ x => x : list (string * (list (string * string) * string))
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### get_functions_types (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --no-agree \"type names are backend-specific\" --symbol\n///> fsharp\n///> rust\n\n:= one ({ a } : { a : i32 }) : i32 = a + 1\n:= two ({ a b } : { a : i32; b : i32 }) : i32 = a + b + 2\n:= fns = { one two }\n:= i32_name = run_target \\| | Fsharp _ => \\ () => ~~ \"int32\" | _ => \\ () => \"i32\"\n\nfns\n|> get_functions_types\n|> listm::map \\ (name, args, result) => name, (args |> listm'::box |> listm'::to_array', result)\n|> listm'::box\n|> listm'::to_array'\n|> sm'::format\n|> _assert_eq' (\n    [\n        \"one\", [ \"a\", i32_name ], i32_name\n        \"two\", [ \"a\", i32_name; \"b\", i32_name ], i32_name\n    ]\n    |> listm::map \\ (name, args, result) => name, (args |> listm'::box |> listm'::to_array', result)\n    |> listm'::box\n    |> listm'::to_array'\n    |> sm'::format\n)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --no-agree "type names are backend-specific" --symbol
  ///> fsharp
  ///> rust

  := one ({ a } : { a : i32 }) : i32 = a + 1
  := two ({ a b } : { a : i32; b : i32 }) : i32 = a + b + 2
  := fns = { one two }
  := i32_name = run_target \| | Fsharp _ => \ () => ~~ "int32" | _ => \ () => "i32"

  fns
  |> get_functions_types
  |> listm::map \ (name, args, result) => name, (args |> listm'::box |> listm'::to_array', result)
  |> listm'::box
  |> listm'::to_array'
  |> sm'::format
  |> _assert_eq' (
      [
          "one", [ "a", i32_name ], i32_name
          "two", [ "a", i32_name; "b", i32_name ], i32_name
      ]
      |> listm::map \ (name, args, result) => name, (args |> listm'::box |> listm'::to_array', result)
      |> listm'::box
      |> listm'::to_array'
      |> sm'::format
  )
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

